    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 3rd level, you can unleash bolts of necrotic energy from within your revived body. Immediately after you use your @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.Item.01pcLg6PRu5zGrsb]{Cunning Action}, you can make a ranged spell attack against a creature within 30 feet of you, provided you haven’t used your @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.classfeatures.Item.DPN2Gfk8yi1Z5wp7]{Sneak Attack} this turn. You are proficient with this attack, and you add your Dexterity modifier to its attack and damage rolls. On a hit, the creature takes necrotic damage equal to your Sneak Attack damage. Making this attack uses your Sneak Attack for the turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-QfGFKeQm4Q4n7Y9n\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The damage uses your Sneak Attack dice plus your Dexterity modifier. Don’t use Sneak Attack again this turn.</p></section>",
